          "en": "**Direct answer:** Molecular alterations of APP in AD studies are associated mainly with early-onset/autosomal-dominant familial AD (FAD/ADAD), altered Aβ production and aggregation, Down syndrome–related AD, cerebral amyloid angiopathy, neuroinflammatory/microglial phenotypes, tauopathy, synaptic and behavioral deficits, and vascular/metabolic changes.",
