          "en": "- **Down syndrome (trisomy 21):** Because *APP* is on chromosome 21, trisomy 21 leads to early Aβ deposition and AD neuropathology, often with dementia by midlife. This is human evidence linking *APP* dosage to AD (PMID: 2892399).",
