        "boundary_en": "Reward supported gene–alteration–mitochondrial-phenotype links, not a name list. Equivalent well-supported genes are acceptable; this is not an exhaustive or compulsory five-gene checklist. Distinguish human findings from model perturbations and gene mutation from protein localization/activity changes.",
        "boundary_zh": "看是否说明有证据支持的“基因—改变—线粒体表型”，不按基因名称数量评分。其他可靠基因例证可认可，本表不是必须逐一命中的五基因清单。区分人类观察与模型干预，区分基因突变和蛋白定位/活性改变。"
