          "en": "- **Lipid peroxidation:** Increased malondialdehyde (MDA), 4-hydroxynonenal (4-HNE), F2-isoprostanes, and acrolein in AD brain, CSF, and plasma; 4-HNE can modify proteins and promote amyloid-beta (Aβ) aggregation. (PMID: 11369029; PMID: 15068966)",
