        "boundary_en": "Credit correctly linked alteration–phenotype examples, not gene names alone. The listed examples are not an exclusive checklist. Distinguish disease-causing mutations from risk alleles and protective variants; do not claim every PSEN mutation raises total Aβ or that APOE4 is deterministic. Equivalent well-supported examples may replace these.",
        "boundary_zh": "看是否说清“改变—表型”关系，不能只列基因名；示例不是唯一清单。区分致病变异、风险等位基因和保护性变异；勿断言所有PSEN变异都提高总Aβ或APOE4必然致病。有可靠证据的等效例子可认可。"
