          "en": "**Direct answer:** The tau protein hypothesis centers on tau hyperphosphorylation, aggregation into neurofibrillary tangles (NFTs), and tau-mediated neurotoxicity, with downstream neuronal loss and cognitive impairment. Evidence also links tau to amyloid-beta (Abeta) pathology, neuroinflammation, and impaired protein clearance.",
          "zh": "**直接回答：** tau蛋白假说集中于tau过度磷酸化、聚集形成神经原纤维缠结（NFTs）以及tau介导的神经毒性，并伴有下游神经元丢失和认知障碍。证据还将tau与淀粉样蛋白-beta（Abeta）病理、神经炎症和蛋白质清除受损联系起来。"
