          "en": "**Direct answer:** Available molecular alteration–phenotype evidence supports the mitochondrial autophagy hypothesis of AD only partially and mostly indirectly. It consistently links AD-related genes and risk variants to mitochondrial dysfunction, but few records demonstrate altered mitophagy flux itself, and most findings are from cell or animal models rather than human tissue.",
          "zh": "**直接回答：** 可获得的分子改变–表型证据仅部分且大多为间接地支持AD的线粒体自噬假说。它一致地将AD相关基因和风险变异与线粒体功能障碍联系起来，但很少有记录证明线粒体自噬通量本身发生改变，且大多数发现来自细胞或动物模型而非人体组织。"
