          {
            "en": "Reports of increased Parkin recruitment or stress-response activation must be distinguished from sufficient degradative flux: compensatory induction can coexist with inadequate clearance capacity. [R45](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25678552/) [R46](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29211722/)",
            "zh": "Parkin招募或应激应答增强不等于降解通量充足：代偿性启动增强可与清除能力不足并存。"
          },
          {
            "en": "Overall, the evidence provides convergent mechanistic support in models and human disease association, but these studies do not prove a standalone cause of human AD or clinical treatment efficacy. [R43](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30742114/) [R44](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28959184/) [R45](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25678552/) [R46](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29211722/)",
            "zh": "总体上，模型中存在相互支持的机制证据，患者中存在疾病关联；这些研究尚不能证明其是人类AD的独立病因或已具临床治疗效果。"
          }
